cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Same Data, Different Answers: Robust Omics Data Analysis from Reads to Biology (MOOC materials)"
abstract: "Materials, scripts and cloud environment of a MOOC on omics data analysis built on the computer practicals of Systems Molecular Biology (University of Córdoba): genome assembly, RNA-seq, label-free and TMT proteomics, functional enrichment and multi-omics integration, with a re-analysis of Dupuis, Ojeda et al. 2025 (The Plant Cell). Every step compares alternative pipelines and measures how much each choice changes the result."
authors:
